        <mxCell id="note" value="数据契约：RobotState → UserCommand → FSM → MotionTarget → Safety → ControlOutput(MIT) → 电机&#xa;迁移状态：实现多在 src/marsdog_control；真机主循环默认仍在 mocap_to_real/walk.py&#xa;验证：tests/parity 黄金快照对拍 motion/executor&#xa;编辑：用 diagrams.net / VS Code Draw.io 插件打开本文件" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=16;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
